# ART-SOV11 -- W3-FIX-A acceptance: SOV11 (SNOW, Moscow). The two map-placed
# Kirovs (ZEP, BalloonHover) start airborne; the Kremlin and the cottages use
# the SNOW art; the invisible lamp posts are not drawn.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign SOV11S.MAP Nod
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 400 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 30
cheat reveal
cheat art_dump
assert art.missing == 0
assert img.ZEP >= 2
assert img.ZEP.air >= 2
cheat view_unit ZEP
wait 2
shot kirov
cheat view_building CARUS03
wait 2
shot kremlin
cheat view_building CAEUR1
wait 2
shot cottages
